{"id":"reflejo","lemma":"reflejo","pos":"noun","rank":3957,"glosses":["reflex","reflection"],"ipa":"/reˈflexo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"reflejos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/da/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-reflejo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Vi mi reflejo en el espejo.","en":"I saw my reflection in the mirror.","words":[{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"mirror"}]},{"text":"Se pueden ver reflejos en los charcos.","en":"Reflections could be seen in the puddles.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/635525","words":[{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to see, to spot"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"puddle, pool","l":"charco"}]},{"text":"Tom vio su reflejo en el espejo.","en":"Tom saw his reflection in the mirror.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/806255","words":[null,{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"mirror"}]},{"text":"Miro mi reflejo en el lago.","en":"I'm looking at my reflection in the lake.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594330","words":[{"g":"portia tree"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"lake"}]},{"text":"Los boxeadores necesitan reflejos rápidos.","en":"Boxers need quick reflexes.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"boxer","l":"boxeador"},{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},null,{"g":"rapid","l":"rápido"}]}]}